# Android Onboarding Starter

This project is the final output for the onboarding and Android environment setup task.

## Output Shown In The App

- Project title
- Days 1-2 onboarding completion
- Days 3-5 environment setup completion
- GitHub repository output
- LinkedIn post output

## How To Open In Android Studio

1. Open Android Studio.
2. Choose **Open**.
3. Select the `AndroidOnboardingStarter` folder.
4. Let Android Studio sync the project.
5. Run the app on an emulator or Android phone.

## Quick Output Preview

Open `OutputPreview.html` in a browser to see the final output without running Android Studio.

## GitHub Setup Commands

```bash
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Initial Android onboarding project"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/your-username/android-onboarding-starter.git
git push -u origin main
```

